            Check whether re-entries helped or hurt the first idea.
          </h2>
          <p className="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-400">
            Round trips stay separate for accounting. This coaching view groups
            same-symbol re-entries so the review can catch profit giveback, open
            re-entries, and trades carried into another session before closing.
          </p>
        </div>
        <Link
